# =============================================================================
# Argos TLS Client Fingerprint Database (tls_ja4.db)
# =============================================================================
# Syntax Format (Pipe-delimited):
# regex_pattern|OS_Name|Score|Device_Type|Vendor
#
# IMPORTANT:
# Argos 5.x emits a compact JA4-like fingerprint derived from the TLS
# ClientHello. It is intentionally NOT byte-compatible with FoxIO JA4:
# hashes are MD5-derived and the 5.x cipher/extension canonicalisation differs.
# Therefore public JA4 hash lists must not be copied here as exact matches.
#
# The initial rules below classify only broad TLS-stack behaviour and remain
# Context evidence (Device_Type=generic). Exact Argos fingerprints learned from
# verified devices can be added above these broad rules with a specific OS/type
# and higher confidence; those specific rows may participate in OS election.
#
# Argos 5.x prefix shape:
#   t<tls-version><d|i><cipher-count><extension-count><alpn-first><alpn-last>
#   followed by _<12-char cipher hash>_<12-char extension hash>
#
# d = SNI/domain present, i = no SNI
# Common ALPN suffixes include h2 (HTTP/2) and h1 (HTTP/1.x).
# =============================================================================
# regex_pattern|OS_Name|Score|Device_Type|Vendor

# --- Modern TLS 1.3 clients (broad/context only) ---
^t13d[0-9]{4}h2_[0-9a-f]{12}_[0-9a-f]{12}$|Modern TLS 1.3 HTTP/2 Client|60|generic|Generic
^t13d[0-9]{4}h1_[0-9a-f]{12}_[0-9a-f]{12}$|Modern TLS 1.3 HTTP/1.x Client|58|generic|Generic
^t13d[0-9]{4}[a-z0-9]{2}_[0-9a-f]{12}_[0-9a-f]{12}$|Modern TLS 1.3 Client|55|generic|Generic
^t13i[0-9]{4}[a-z0-9]{2}_[0-9a-f]{12}_[0-9a-f]{12}$|TLS 1.3 Client (No SNI)|50|generic|Generic

# --- TLS 1.2 clients (broad/context only) ---
^t12d[0-9]{4}h2_[0-9a-f]{12}_[0-9a-f]{12}$|TLS 1.2 HTTP/2 Client|52|generic|Generic
^t12d[0-9]{4}h1_[0-9a-f]{12}_[0-9a-f]{12}$|TLS 1.2 HTTP/1.x Client|50|generic|Generic
^t12d[0-9]{4}[a-z0-9]{2}_[0-9a-f]{12}_[0-9a-f]{12}$|TLS 1.2 Client|48|generic|Generic
^t12i[0-9]{4}[a-z0-9]{2}_[0-9a-f]{12}_[0-9a-f]{12}$|TLS 1.2 Client (No SNI)|45|generic|Generic
